{
  "version": 9,
  "canonical_statement": "AI-0/AI-1 pueden leer, auditar, proponer y ejecutar Doctor readonly; AI-2 solo puede crear AIDraft o evidencia append-only aprobada mediante EVIDENCE_WRITE; AI-2 no aplica cambios sobre código, migraciones, schemas, catálogos, contratos técnicos ni archivos protegidos del producto; el modo development_mode debe registrarse en S0-000A; ninguna escritura IA protegida puede aplicarse sobre archivos protegidos del producto si development_mode=ai_prepared_changes_enabled sin ADR-026 activada por owner humano mediante activation_contract verificable, Git local mínimo, baseline commit, working tree limpio, Doctor previo/posterior, ApprovalRecord y trazabilidad; AI-3 reservado; AI-4 prohibido. External roadmap tools are human-executed local commands for AI-first development and do not expand AI runtime permissions or bypass ADR-026.",
  "approval_record_fields": [
    "id",
    "requested_by",
    "approved_by",
    "action_type",
    "permission_requested",
    "scope",
    "risk_level",
    "files_affected",
    "rollback_plan",
    "status",
    "expires_at",
    "evidence_ref",
    "created_at",
    "approved_at",
    "consumed_at",
    "scope_hash",
    "idempotency_key",
    "consumed_by_action_id"
  ],
  "forbidden_even_with_approval": [
    "secrets.read",
    "secrets.write",
    "production.modify",
    "destructive_sql.execute",
    "fabricate_evidence"
  ],
  "audit_entity": "AIActionLog",
